      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>emptyDir represents a temporary directory that shares a pod’s lifetime. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/volumes#emptydir</p></dd>
