      <TableRow>
      <TableHead>Property</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Type</TableHead>
      <TableHead>Description</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>metadata</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>May contain labels and annotations that will be copied into the PVC when creating it. No other fields are allowed and will be rejected during validation.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>spec</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>The specification for the PersistentVolumeClaim. The entire content is copied unchanged into the PVC that gets created from this template. The same fields as in a PersistentVolumeClaim are also valid here.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
