      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>gcePersistentDisk represents a GCE Disk resource that is attached to a kubelet’s host machine and then exposed to the pod. Deprecated: GCEPersistentDisk is deprecated. All operations for the in-tree gcePersistentDisk type are redirected to the pd.csi.storage.gke.io CSI driver. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/volumes#gcepersistentdisk</p></dd>
